# Text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with LF everywhere.
#
# Without this line, Git on Windows converts them to CRLF in the working copy, `git status` then calls every one of them
# modified after a build, and `git diff` shows nothing at all — a clone that can never look clean on Windows. The platform
# reads the same clone, so it saw six changed paths where one had changed.
* text=auto eol=lf
